persons:
    person-janos-slynt:
        properties:
            house: Slynt
            name:
                fields:
                    given: Janos
                    surname: Slynt
                value: Janos Slynt
            sex: male
            title:
                - date: TO 299
                  value: Commander of the City Watch of King's Landing
                - date: FROM 298 TO 299
                  value: Lord of Harrenhal
        notes: Former commander of the City Watch of King's Landing (the gold cloaks). ACOK appendix lists him both as 'LORD JANOS SLYNT, Commander of the City Watch' on the small council and 'JANOS SLYNT, Lord of Harrenhal, Lord Commander' in the City Watch section. Briefly Lord of Harrenhal before being sent to the Wall by Tyrion.
